<title>USA: NY bank discount window borrowings Oct 2 week.</title>
<headline>NY bank discount window borrowings Oct 2 week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fewer than half of the six major New York City banks borrowed from the Federal Reserve's discount window in the week ended October 2, a Fed spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said he was unable to provide a figure because the borrowing did not take place on Wednesday and it was the first week of the period.</p>
<p>It was the middle of the two-week bank maintenance period.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
</text>
